@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 200
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
left to right direction
title macpro-appian-connector - System Architecture

' Users
rectangle "Developer" as Dev
rectangle "Operator/DevOps" as Ops
rectangle "Repository Maintainer" as Maint

' Local Environment
node "Local Environment\n(Terminal & Scripts)" as Local {
  component "Stage Listing Script\n(run listRunningStages)" as StageScript
  component "Connector Config Handler" as ConfigHandler
  component "Connector Mgmt Library" as ConnLib
  package "Metrics Collectors" as Metrics {
    component "Deploy Metrics Collector" as DeployMetrics
    component "PR Merge Metrics Collector" as PRMetrics
  }
  artifact "AWS CLI Credentials" as AwsCreds
}

' AWS Account
node "AWS Account (current region)" as AWS {
  component "Project Service\n(event producer)" as Service
  component "AWS Event Routing\n(EventBridge Rule)" as EventBridge
  component "SNS Topic\n(Notifications)" as SNS
  folder "SNS Subscriptions\n(manual targets)" as Subs
  component "Target Cluster & Service\n(BigMAC Connectors)" as ClusterService
}

' GitHub
cloud "GitHub" as GH {
  node "GitHub Actions" as GHA {
    component "deploy.yml Workflow" as DeployWorkflow
  }
  database "GitHub API" as GHAPI {
    component "Workflow Runs Endpoint" as RunsAPI
    component "Pull Requests Endpoint" as PRsAPI
  }
}

' User interactions
Dev --> StageScript : run stage listing
Ops --> StageScript : run AWS-scoped operations
Ops --> Subs : manage subscriptions (manual)
Maint --> ConfigHandler : manage connector definitions
Maint --> DeployMetrics : collect deploy metrics
Maint --> PRMetrics : collect PR merge metrics

' Local interactions
StageScript --> AwsCreds : requires
StageScript --> AWS : query running stages
ConfigHandler --> ConnLib
ConnLib --> ClusterService : put connectors\n delete(empty set)\n restart connectors

' Event routing
Service --> EventBridge : emit runtime events
EventBridge --> SNS : route matching events
SNS --> Subs : deliver notifications

' Metrics flows
DeployMetrics --> RunsAPI : query deploy.yml workflow runs\n(paginated per_page=100)
PRMetrics --> PRsAPI : query closed PRs for base branch\n(paginated per_page=100)
RunsAPI --> DeployMetrics : workflow run records\n(conclusion field)
PRsAPI --> PRMetrics : PR records\n(created_at, merged_at)
DeployMetrics --> Maint : output failedRuns, passedRuns
PRMetrics --> Maint : output averageTimeToMerge

' Notes
note right of StageScript
- Operates after onboarding and AWS CLI setup
- Constrained to current AWS account and region
- Output: runningStages=<comma-separated stages>
end note

note right of ConfigHandler
Applies connector definitions to target cluster and service:
- put configured connectors
- delete with empty deletion set (no deletions)
- restart configured connectors
end note

note right of EventBridge
Event rule filters matching service events
end note

note right of SNS
SNS topic authorized for event-routing invocation
end note

note right of Subs
Subscriptions managed manually, decoupled from deployment automation
end note

note right of DeployMetrics
Compute:
- failedRuns = runs with conclusion != success
- passedRuns = total - failedRuns
end note

note right of PRMetrics
Compute averageTimeToMerge as whole-hour differences;
default 0 when no qualifying PRs
end note
@enduml
